This admission is specified under (`req:nrz:cas-series-design-standing`) and advertises no executable capability. It depends on the Q symbolic residual stage of (`req:nrz:cas-series-design-symbolic-residual`) and does not replace it. Other coefficient domains, nonrational source-origin laws, a regular-singular theorem and valuation-aware precision strengthening remain separate proposals. Bessel identities, identification of the residual with a named analytic function, convergence and all modelling remain consumer premises under (`cav:nrz:cas-trig-series-exclusions`) and (`req:nrz:cas-series-design-source-contract`). The admission certifies only the stated finite algebraic consequences.

